OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA narrow
OL,6,Fband of rain will clear away south
OL,7,Fthis evening. A brief drier interlude
OL,8,Ffollows, with some clear spells,
OL,9,Fbefore cloud thickens with further
OL,10,Foutbreaks of rain towards dawn. Chilly
OL,11,Fin the north, milder in the south.
OL,12,FWinds easing.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FOutbreaks of rain and drizzle
OL,15,Fat times, but possibly a drier
OL,16,Finterlude around lunchtime for most,
OL,17,Fwith brighter spells. Light winds.
OL,18,FCooler than Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
