OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FLargely dry with sunny spells
OL,7,FWednesday, after a chilly start.
OL,8,FMostly dry with sunny spells Thursday.
OL,9,FChance of a few coastal showers.
OL,10,FBreezier, with rain spreading east
OL,11,FFriday. Cooler.
